1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,789
Section B question one part (b): name two input devices for checking product codes in the warehouse, each with one advantage.

2
00:00:08,789 --> 00:00:13,430
Example: barcode or Q R scanner — fast input, fewer typing errors.

3
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:18,000
Or: handheld data terminal — check beside the shelf in real time.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,094
Or: R F I D reader — read many tags at once.

5
00:00:21,094 --> 00:00:26,016
Remember: device plus advantage; do not treat output devices as input.

